{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Add-the-package","text":"Add the package","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"text":". In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.9.0\")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Register the wallet","level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Provide the keys and the storage","level":3,"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider","level":3,"anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","isActive":true},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Create the wallet","level":3,"anchor":"Create-the-wallet","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"text":"Ship the release build","level":3,"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next steps","level":3,"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting started","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","title":"WalletProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","title":"OID4VCWallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"CredentialStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform’s data protection. ","type":"text"},{"code":"FileCredentialStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the standard one.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","title":"holderAccessGroup","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every key is in the default group.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore/inAppGroup(_:options:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inAppGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Options","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC7OptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19FileCredentialStoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"inAppGroup(_:options:)","abstract":[{"text":"A store in the app group ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"text":"’s container","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(Library\/Application Support\/credentials there), which the app and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its extensions listing the group in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.application-groups"},{"text":" entitlement share.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore\/inappgroup(_:options:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GoingToProduction":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction","title":"Going to production","abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"KeyStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys: P-256 keys whose private halves never leave the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store (the Secure Enclave). ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"text":" is the standard one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A thrown error reaches Go and comes back as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"text":" WalletError.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keystore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","title":"Presenting in person","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson","abstract":[{"text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"FileCredentialStore","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileCredentialStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ReceivingCredentials":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials","title":"Receiving credentials","abstract":[{"text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and look after them once they’re held.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Wallet","abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isTestBuild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"isTestBuild","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-tags mobiletest"},{"text":"): an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should refuse to run on it.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingFromALink":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","title":"Presenting from a link","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink","abstract":[{"text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/network":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"network","abstract":[{"text":"A request couldn’t be made, got no answer, or timed out. Retryable.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/network"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","title":"platform","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"platform","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message follows.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"title":"Presenting to Safari","abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HandlingErrors":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/handlingerrors","title":"Handling errors","abstract":[{"text":"Tell the holder what went wrong, retry what may succeed, and log what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helps without personal data.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"title":"WalletConfiguration","abstract":[{"text":"NewWallet’s configuration.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration"}}}